      "message": "test: Cover paused-send timeout lifecycle\n\nExercise the paused-send timeout independently of recent send and receive\nactivity. Check that enqueueing and send attempts preserve the original\npause time, the timeout boundary remains exclusive, and draining the\nbuffer permits a subsequent pause to start a fresh interval.\n\nUse a mock clock and existing socket test doubles for deterministic\ncoverage. Verify that draining sends bytes before the pause clears.\nProduction networking behavior is unchanged.",
